keywords:
  - Erdős–Gyárfás conjecture
  - cycles of length a power of two
  - cubic graphs
  - extremal graph theory
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
abstract: >-
  Kernel-checked Lean 4 proofs, graph certificates, independent checkers, and
  papers for results on small graphs without cycles whose length is a power of
  two, motivated by the Erdős–Gyárfás conjecture.
